# Clients that are never banned.
#
# A request for a .php file, a .env file or a WordPress path gets its client
# blocked at Cloudflare (Application::banNefariousRequest()). A client listed
# here is not blocked: its request is answered like any other.
#
# The live copy is app/config/allowed-ips.lst and is never committed.
#
# One entry per line: a plain IP or a CIDR range, IPv4 or IPv6.
# `#` starts a comment, on its own line or after an entry.
#
# 203.0.113.5          # the office
# 198.51.100.0/24
# 2001:db8::/32
